  "name": "Cheesy Bratwurst Stew",
  "subtitle": "A hearty slow-cooked stew with sausage, vegetables, and cheddar.",
  "description": "Browned bratwurst, potatoes, vegetables, and creamy soup cook together before being finished with melted cheddar.",
  "meal_type": "soup",
